 *   Sensor 2 -> GPIO17
 *   Sensor 3 -> GPIO27
 *   Motor A -> GPIO22 (PWM)
 *   Motor B -> GPIO23 (PWM)
 *   Motor C -> GPIO24 (PWM)
 *            -> GPIO25 (PWM)
 *   Motor driver commons tied to Pi 3.3V
 *
 * Control law:
 *   If sensor 2 (middle) reads low, drive straight.
 *   If only sensor 1 reads low, turn right.
 *   If only sensor 3 reads low, turn left.
 *   If none reads low, stop.
